00:00:01.200 --> 00:00:09.976
&gt;&gt;&gt; A NEW LOOK SENATOR EDWARD
KENNEDY'S LIFE, HIS DIARY

00:00:09.976 --> 00:00:14.447
DETAILS WHAT HE TOOK FROM SAMUEL
ALITO TO RESPECT THE PRECEDENT

00:00:14.447 --> 00:00:17.250
OF THE ROE V. WADE RULING.
IT DETAILS CONVERSATIONS THAT HE

00:00:17.250 --> 00:00:22.689
HAD WITH ALITO BACK IN 2005.
SENATOR KENNEDY RECORDS ALITO AS

00:00:22.689 --> 00:00:25.558
VOWING TO, QUOTE, ADHERE TO
PRECEDENT.

00:00:25.558 --> 00:00:28.461
SAYING I BELIEVE IN A RIGHT TO
PRIVACY AND CALLING THE MATTER,

00:00:28.461 --> 00:00:31.064
QUOTE, SETTLED.
FAST FORWARD 16 YEARS.

00:00:31.064 --> 00:00:35.034
IT WAS JUSTICE ALITO WHO WROTE
THE DECISION ERASING ROE V. WADE

00:00:35.034 --> 00:00:38.605
THIS SUMMER AND ENDING ITS
GUARANTEE TO ABORTION RIGHTS,

00:00:38.605 --> 00:00:43.176
FEDERAL GUARANTEE.
THE REVELATION COMES FROM THIS

00:00:43.176 --> 00:00:46.479
NEW BOOK, INCLUDING
NEVER-BEFORE-SEEN EXCERPTS FROM

00:00:46.479 --> 00:00:50.683
THE SENATOR'S OWN DIARY.
THE AUTHOR JOINS US NOW.

00:00:50.683 --> 00:00:54.954
IT'S GREAT TO SEE YOU.
LET'S CONTINUE FIRST ON THIS

00:00:54.954 --> 00:00:56.689
THEME.
WE NOW LIVE IN THE DOBBS

00:00:56.689 --> 00:00:59.025
AMERICA, NOT THE ROE V. WADE
AMERICA.

00:00:59.025 --> 00:01:02.795
ABORTION IS STATE BY STATE.
SENATOR KENNEDY SUCH A PLAYER IN

00:01:02.795 --> 00:01:05.365
THE DAY.
YOU WROTE A PIECE IN "THE NEW

00:01:05.365 --> 00:01:07.667
YORK TIMES" YESTERDAY ABOUT
KENNEDY ASKING HIM, BECAUSE

00:01:07.667 --> 00:01:10.803
ALITO HAD WRITTEN A MEMO WHERE
HE SAID I OPPOSE ROE.

00:01:10.803 --> 00:01:14.707
JUDGE ALITO ASSURED MR. KENNEDY
HE SHOULD NOT PUT TOO MUCH STOCK

00:01:14.707 --> 00:01:17.143
IN THE MEMO.
HE HAD BEEN SEEKING A PROMOTION

00:01:17.143 --> 00:01:19.779
AND WROTE WHAT HE THOUGHT HIS
BOSSES WANTED TO HEAR.

00:01:19.779 --> 00:01:22.515
I WAS A YOUNGER PERSON, JUDGE
ALITO SAID.

00:01:22.515 --> 00:01:26.252
I HAVE MATURED A LOT.
A, THE CONSEQUENCES OF THIS BUT

00:01:26.252 --> 00:01:31.925
JUST, B, WHAT DID YOU LEARN
GOING THROUGH THIS FASCINATING

00:01:31.925 --> 00:01:34.360
DIARY?
&gt;&gt; AS YOU KNOW, TED KENNEDY HAD

00:01:34.360 --> 00:01:37.630
BEEN ONE OF THE LEADERS IN THE
BATTLE TO DEFEAT ROBERT BORK

00:01:37.630 --> 00:01:40.300
BACK IN THE REAGAN YEARS WHEN
BORK WAS DOMINATED TO THE

00:01:40.300 --> 00:01:41.734
SUPREME COURT.
AND THE LESSON THAT THE

00:01:41.734 --> 00:01:46.439
REPUBLICAN PARTY CAME AWAY FROM
WAS THAT WE CAN'T HAVE OUR

00:01:46.439 --> 00:01:49.242
NOMINEES GOING UP THERE AND
DOING INTELLECTUAL COMBAT WITH

00:01:49.242 --> 00:01:52.312
THE MEMBERS OF THE SENATE
BECAUSE WE SOUND TO HEARTLESS

00:01:52.312 --> 00:01:55.848
AND WE SOUND LIKE WE ARE GOING
TO DO A WHOLE BUNCH OF STUFF

00:01:55.848 --> 00:01:56.950
THAT THE AMERICAN PEOPLE DON'T
WANT.

00:01:56.950 --> 00:02:01.287
SO WE'RE GOING TO HAVE THEM GO
UP AND IN A SUCCESSION OF RIP

00:02:01.287 --> 00:02:05.124
NOMINEES WENT UP AND ALL SAID
THINGS LIKE I WILL RESPECT

00:02:05.124 --> 00:02:08.261
PRECEDENT.
I HONOR WHAT'S HAPPENED BEFORE.

00:02:08.261 --> 00:02:15.235
THERE'S A JUDICIAL THEORY CALLED
STARE DECISIS WHICH MEANS WE

00:02:15.235 --> 00:02:18.538
DON'T GO BACK AND WRECK
50-YEAR-OLD JUDICIAL DECISIONS.

00:02:18.538 --> 00:02:21.474
SO WHEN HE WAS IN THIS PRIVATE
CONVERSATION WITH TED KENNEDY,

00:02:21.474 --> 00:02:26.713
JUDGE ALITO SAID THINGS LIKE I
RESPECT PRECEDENT.

00:02:26.713 --> 00:02:29.015
I BELIEVE I'M GOING TO ADHERE TO
THAT.

00:02:29.015 --> 00:02:30.850
I HAVE CONSTITUTIONAL
RESPONSIBILITIES.

00:02:30.850 --> 00:02:36.222
ALL THINGS THAT SORT OF GIVE THE
INCLINATION THAT HE WOULD BE AT

00:02:36.222 --> 00:02:39.726
LEAST A NEUTRAL PERSON ON
SOMETHING LIKE ROE V. WADE AND

00:02:39.726 --> 00:02:43.229
OF COURSE HE WAS NOT.
HE WROTE THE DECISION THAT

00:02:43.229 --> 00:02:45.331
OVERTURNED IT.
&gt;&gt; OF COURSE HE WAS NOT.

00:02:45.331 --> 00:02:48.901
IT'S FASCINATING.
SO MANY BOOKS HAVE BEEN WRITTEN

00:02:48.901 --> 00:02:51.504
ABOUT THE SENATOR THAT IT IS
REMARKABLE THE REPORTER YOU'VE

00:02:51.504 --> 00:02:54.240
DONE TO FIND SO MANY NEW
DETAILS, INCLUDING ABOUT ONE OF

00:02:54.240 --> 00:03:06.819
THE GREAT TRAGEDIES IN SENATOR
KENNEDY'S LIFE, THE ACCIDENT AT

00:03:06.819 --> 00:03:07.887
C
CHAPPAQUIDDICK.

00:03:07.887 --> 00:03:12.592
YOU GOT ACTRESS TO ARTHUR
SCHLESSINGER AND ADVISOR TO

00:03:12.592 --> 00:03:17.463
PRESIDENT KENNEDY.
IN THIS DIARY JEAN THINKS THAT

00:03:17.463 --> 00:03:20.533
TEDDY PANICKED.
HE HOPED THAT HE COULD FIND SOME

00:03:20.533 --> 00:03:26.372
WAY TO COVER IT ALL UP.
WHAT ELSE DID YOU LEARN ABOUT

00:03:26.372 --> 00:03:29.275
CHAPPAQUIDDICK?
&gt;&gt; FIRST OF ALL, THAT HE REALLY

00:03:29.275 --> 00:03:33.579
WAS PANICKED BUT HE WAS ALSO
POSSIBLY SUFFERING THE EFFECTS

00:03:33.579 --> 00:03:36.649
OF A CONCUSSION FROM THE CAR
ACCIDENT.

00:03:36.649 --> 00:03:42.555
HE WAS IN THIS SORT OF DREAM
WORLD OF IMAGINE NAL MAGICAL

00:03:42.555 --> 00:03:46.892
THINKING WHERE HE HOPED HE WOULD
SEE MARY JO WALKING DOWN THE

00:03:46.892 --> 00:03:50.796
ROAD BUT IN THE END HE MADE A
VERY COLD DECISION THAT EVEN HIS

00:03:50.796 --> 00:03:54.600
MOTHER, ROSE KENNEDY, FAULTED
HIM FOR, WHICH WAS TO GO TO

00:03:54.600 --> 00:03:57.570
EDGARTOWN, GET DRESSED, GO DOWN
TO A HOTEL LOBBY IN THE MIDDLE

00:03:57.570 --> 00:04:02.175
OF THE MORNING AND THEN HAVE
BREAKFAST WITH FRIENDS ON THE

00:04:02.175 --> 00:04:05.878
BALCONY AND MAKE IT SEEM THAT HE
HAD NOT BEEN THERE.

00:04:05.878 --> 00:04:09.816
FINALLY TWO OF HIS AIDES AND
FRIENDS CAME TO HIM AND SAID YOU

00:04:09.816 --> 00:04:13.919
CAN'T DO THIS.
YOU HAVE TO GO REPORT THE CRIME.

00:04:13.919 --> 00:04:18.291
AND THAT WAS WHAT HE HAD TOLD
JEAN KENNEDY SMITH, HIS SISTER.

00:04:18.291 --> 00:04:21.561
SO THE FIRST TIME WE HAVE THIS
TALE CONFIRMED OUT OF THE

00:04:21.561 --> 00:04:23.930
SENATOR'S OWN MOUTH.
&gt;&gt; YOU ALSO HAVE IN HERE AND IT

00:04:23.930 --> 00:04:26.399
FITS WITH THIS, ABOUT HIS ROLE
IN THE FAMILY HERE.

00:04:26.399 --> 00:04:29.735
THERE ARE PEOPLE WHO CAN MESS UP
IN LIFE AND NOT GET CAUGHT.

00:04:29.735 --> 00:04:33.372
TED KENNEDY'S FATHER, JOSEPH,
TOLD HIM YOU'RE NOT ONE OF THEM.

00:04:33.372 --> 00:04:39.645
&gt;&gt; THE WHOLE BOOK IS ALMOST A
SHAKESPEAREAN TRAGEDY, ABOUT THE

00:04:39.645 --> 00:04:43.149
YOUNGEST SON WHO NEVER EXPECTED
TO HAVE TO SHOULDER THE BURDENS

00:04:43.149 --> 00:04:46.919
OF THE CROWN.
THROUGH AN INCREDIBLE SERIES OF

00:04:46.919 --> 00:04:50.022
EVENTS, THE THREE OLDER BROTHERS
SUFFER VIOLENT DEATHS.

00:04:50.022 --> 00:04:54.227
HERE'S TEDDY UNPREPARED, IGNORED
FOR LARGE SECTIONS OF HIS

00:04:54.227 --> 00:04:58.297
CHILDHOOD AND NOW HE'S THE ONE
WHO HAS TO CARRY THE BURDEN,

00:04:58.297 --> 00:05:01.300
CARRY THE MANTLE FORWARD.
&gt;&gt; FASCINATING WORK ABOUT A

00:05:01.300 --> 00:05:03.970
FASCINATING MAN.
APPRECIATE YOUR TIME TODAY,

